  "description": "MCP server for querying Polymarket prediction market data via The Graph subgraphs.\n\nExposes 9 tools that AI agents (Claude, Cursor, etc.) can use to query market data, trader P&L, positions, activity, and orderbook trades.\n\nPrerequisites\nYou need a free Graph API key (takes ~2 minutes):\n\nGo to The Graph Studio\nConnect your wallet (MetaMask, WalletConnect, etc.)\nClick \"API Keys\" in the sidebar and create one\nFree tier includes 100,000 queries/month",
